      <div class="stick">
        <div class="wrap grid">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">How we work</span>
            <h2 id="proc-h" data-split>How does working with us <em>run?</em></h2>
            <p>The same four steps on every engagement, whether we start with one channel or all of them.</p>
            <div class="snav" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="pin-fill"></span>
              <div class="sn on" data-step-nav><span>01</span>Diagnose</div><div class="sn" data-step-nav><span>02</span>Plan</div><div class="sn" data-step-nav><span>03</span>Launch</div><div class="sn" data-step-nav><span>04</span>Grow</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="panels">
            <div class="panel on" data-step><div><h3>01 Diagnose</h3><p>We read your numbers channel by channel and find where revenue is lost: traffic, conversion, follow-up or retention.</p><ul><li>90 days of ad, CRM and email data</li><li>A test lead through your funnel, timed</li><li>Baseline for every number we will report</li></ul></div><img class="i3" src="/img/3d/diagnose.webp" alt="3D magnifying glass over a chart for the diagnosis step" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy" /></div>
            <div class="panel" data-step><div><h3>02 Plan</h3><p>You get a written plan that ranks every fix and channel by expected revenue, with the budget each one needs.</p><ul><li>Fixes first, new traffic second</li><li>Budget per channel with a target cost per customer</li><li>What we will stop doing, in writing</li></ul></div><img class="i3" src="/img/3d/funnel.webp" alt="3D sales funnel with coins for the planning step" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy" /></div>
            <div class="panel" data-step><div><h3>03 Launch</h3><p>We build and run the campaigns, content, outreach, pages and automations, with your approval on anything public.</p><ul><li>Creative, copy and pages produced in-house</li><li>Tracking checked before money is spent</li><li>Weekly numbers from the first week</li></ul></div><img class="i3" src="/img/3d/plane.webp" alt="3D paper plane taking off for the launch step" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy" /></div>
            <div class="panel" data-step><div><h3>04 Grow</h3><p>Monthly reports tie spend to revenue. Budget moves to what earns, and what does not earn is cut.</p><ul><li>One report across every channel</li><li>New channels added only when the first pay</li><li>Quarterly reset of goals and budget</li></ul></div><img class="i3" src="/img/3d/growth.webp" alt="3D rising bar chart with coins for the growth step" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy" /></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

